          "request": {
            "name": "Cancel Shipment",
            "description": {
              "content": "This API initiates the cancellation process with the shipping company. Shipments cannot be canceled once they have reached the \" picked up \" status. Some shipping companies do not support shipment cancellations, which may result in a failure response indicating the shipment could not be canceled. Request Parameters: Name Required Type Description orderId yes( if there is no otoId) string orderId from which shipment was created otoId yes( if there is no orderId) string Unique id created by OTO. s",
              "type": "text/plain"
